{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっほい♪\nRottyです (^^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/21/9641035/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ.  いきなり\nこんな写メ...   笑☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめねっ  (/>ω<)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、乃木メン団体で\n乃木神社へと行ったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ他の用事で\n行けてなくって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日 １人できっちりと\n行ってきましたよ(*´ω`*)goo !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぇい♪るん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それにしてもさー\nそれにしてもさー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は 本当\n楽しかったんだよぉ〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねえ？  聞いてくれるぅ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぢゃあ今から色々と\n書くねぇ〜〜 〃ω〃"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/21/9641035/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、15時頃に乃木神社☆に\n着きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、入って\nちゃーーんと\nお願いごとしてきました*^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長すぎたかな♪? ...\n5分位 目閉じてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嘘。盛った (^ω^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでさっ、\n絵馬..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂family★の皆\nRotty夢☆の皆\n本当にありがとうございます(／_・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『川村真洋ちゃんが選抜復帰\nできますように...。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『川村真洋のファンが\n１人でも増えます様に...。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『アンダーメンバーの\n活躍の場が増えます様に...。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木坂46が国民的アイドルに\nなります様に...。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だとか 他にもたくさん\n書いてくれていたね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しかったです(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと ごめんないっ !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉し過ぎて写メ撮らせて\n頂きました^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして 交通安全の御守りを買って\nバッグにしまっまて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社をでました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあっ )))\nここからどーしましょぉ。？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰る?  ...ぃゃぃゃ ちゃう\nちょっとお散歩をしよう ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/21/9641035/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりあえず乃木坂にある坂を\n１人でルンルンしながら\n歩いたよっ (・▽・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も 坂登ってゆけます様に...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思いながらねっ ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・・・・。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局そっから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂〜渋谷まで\n歩いて行っちゃいました 。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"六本木とかも通りながら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"永遠にまっすぐ...かなり歩いた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷についてからも\n歩き続けたから,,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日 3時間位\n道、歩き続けた(´▽`)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも その時に感じたことが\nたくさんあったんだお...(´ω`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩いていたら、\nどっかにそれて行く道や\n斜め前に上がって行く階段,"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"凸凹道や\n氷がまだ残ってて危ない所も\nあった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく今日は寄り道しないで\nおこうと思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただひたすら 真っ直ぐ\n歩き続けることにしました(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか 人生って\nこうやって今歩いている道と\n同じだなって思いました *^^*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どー言ったらいいんだろう ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか歩きながら\n色々考えた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しったよお ♪!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の夢も 描いた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤のヘッドフォンして\nマイケル・ジャクソンの BAD★\n聞きながら歩いた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高層ビルがたくさんあって\n壁が 鏡になってる建物とかが\nあって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歩いてる自分の姿が\n色んな角度から一気に\n見える瞬間があった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ああ.  そうやでな♪\n自分のことを色んな角度から\n... ... ... 。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思った (*´▽`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中 前が見えない位\n太陽の光で眩しかった道も\nあったよ *´▽`*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"光で表示とか何も見えないから\nとりあえず ただただ真っ直ぐ\n歩いてた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたら たどりついた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"渋谷に /"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のほほぉ〜ん (⌒‐⌒)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に 昨日は自分にとって\nいい１日だった ^^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木神社で買った御守りは\n実家に送りました(・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「美人になるのど飴」ってのも\n一緒に送ったよ (・▽・)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お医者さんでもらう\nお薬が入ってる白い袋あるでしょ?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれに「美人になるのど飴」\nって書いてる アメちゃんを\n見つけてしまって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"面白いな(・ω・)と思って\n買っちゃったんだあ ♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は朝からずっと\n写真撮影があって\nまた色んな服を着て撮ったよん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい感じに撮れたかなー´・▽・?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして夜は 新しい曲の振り入れ\nをやってきました...´▽`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/01/21/9641035/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変顔ぉ〜〜(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blog見てくれて\nありがとん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは皆ちゃま\nおやすみなさいぃぃ(〃ω〃)のし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Rottyより 。"}],"source":"archive"}